{
  "description": "The commit list: which steps wait for the person's approval. Both hosts' holds and Anton's card read it. url is the page's address, element the element the step names (null for none), and held is \"commit\" (one approval runs this step once), \"position\" (one approval covers steps by position on this page address) or null (runs at once). A click holds when the element is named with submit, buy, pay, order, purchase, checkout, check out, send, delete, remove, transfer, confirm, post, publish, authorize or grant (whole words, any case), when it has no name, and anywhere on an OAuth authorization or consent page: a path segment authorize or consent, or a last segment auth under an oauth segment. type with submit true or a line break, and press of a key ending in Enter, hold outside a search field: role searchbox, or a name containing search. A click or drag with an x and y holds as position. Nothing else holds.",
  "examples": {
    "a click on Submit": {
      "where": "commit list",
      "kind": "classification",
      "body": {
        "url": "https://shop.example.test/cart",
        "element": {
          "role": "button",
          "name": "Submit"
        },
        "step": {
          "action": "click",
          "element": 7
        },
        "held": "commit"
      }
    },
